timelapse-controller (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Flask web application for Raspberry Pi timelapse control
  * Three-tab interface: Controls, Settings, Media
  * Automatic video generation with FFmpeg/OpenCV support
  * Real-time media gallery with auto-refresh
  * Systemd service for automatic startup at boot
  * Camera orientation controls (flip support)
  * Scheduled daily video creation
  * Multiple video resolutions and quality settings
  * Session-free simplified recording system

 -- Gordon Hollingworth <gordon@raspberrypi.com>  Fri, 12 Sep 2025 14:30:00 +0000
